# Build context = worktree root. The emulator images only need tools/, specs/ and
# emulators/; everything else is either generated, virtualenv, VCS metadata or a
# test artifact. Without this file the context included .venv/ and out/ (hundreds
# of MB) and a single `compose up --build` spent tens of minutes transferring it.
#
# PATTERN SEMANTICS (Docker/Podman .dockerignore): a bare pattern is matched
# against the path RELATIVE TO THE CONTEXT ROOT, so `out` only excludes
# `<context>/out` and NEVER `<context>/tools/synthetic_clouds/out`. The heavy
# tree in this repo is nested, so every generated directory that can appear at
# any depth MUST use the `**/` prefix. Measured on 2026-10-28: `out` alone left
# tools/synthetic_clouds/out in the context -- 5.67 GB / 133.748 files, and the
# `compose up --build` of the GCP plane never finished its context transfer.
# `**/out` drops that tree; the images never needed it (gitignored, 0 tracked
# files, only mypy/ruff caches and pytest artifacts).
.git
**/.venv
**/out
**/pytest-of-*
**/evidence-tmp
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.artifacts
**/.benchmarks
**/.worktrees
**/.kiro
**/.agents
**/uvcache
**/d3bis
deploy
docs
tests
scripts
services
**/*.xml
